# PROJECT DEPLOYMENT CONTEXT

- **DEPLOYMENT INFRASTRUCTURE**: CLOUDFLARE PAGES / WORKERS.
- **NEVER USE VERCEL**: Do NOT run any Vercel commands (`vercel`, `vercel --prod`, etc.). Vercel is deprecated for this project.
- **DEPLOYMENT WORKFLOW**: 
  - To deploy changes to production (ytuong.fedu.vn), simply commit and push your changes to the `main` branch. 
  - Cloudflare Git Integration will automatically build and deploy the root directory to production.
  - DO NOT attempt to run manual CLI deployment unless explicitly asked.

# DATA ARCHITECTURE
- Curation data is generated by `build_ideas_bank.py` or `analyze_and_upload.py`.
- No generated code boilerplate should be pushed to `.html` or `.json` without manual alignment rules.
